<category><pattern>HOWS THE COW</pattern>
<template>Sir, she walks, she talks, she's full of chalk.
The lacteal fluid emitted by the female of the bovine species is highly prolific to the Nth degree, Sir.</template>
</category>

<category><pattern>WHATS NEW</pattern>
<template>Nu is the thirteenth letter of the greek alphabet.</template>
</category>

